# REQUIRED REAL DOGFOOD

After fixing the two P0 bugs, execute ALL of these yourself.

### 1

```bash
conciencia work
```

Must not traceback.

### 2

```bash
conciencia work timeline --since 2026-08-27
```

Must return actual WorkItems ordered correctly.

### 3

```bash
conciencia work summarize --since 2026-08-27
```

Must produce a real evidence-backed summary.

### 4

```bash
conciencia work search "WebMCP"
```

Must return relevant workspace history.

At this stage lexical/hybrid search is acceptable if embeddings are not configured.

Clearly report whether retrieval was:

```text
lexical
hybrid
semantic
```

Do not claim semantic search if no embedding provider/index was used.

### 5

```bash
conciencia ask "Resumime todo lo que desarrollé desde el 27 de agosto hasta hoy"
```

Expected route:

```text
workspace_summary
```

It MUST answer from Work retrieval.

It MUST NOT create a Research Mission.

### 6

```bash
conciencia ask "¿Qué hicimos para WebMCP?"
```

Expected:

```text
workspace_query
```

It should retrieve actual WorkItems/Evidence.

### 7

```bash
conciencia report create \
  --from-work \
  --since 2026-08-27 \
  --project Conciencia
```

Must create and persist a report successfully.

Then:

```bash
conciencia report
conciencia report inspect <created-id>
```

must work.

