# QUALITY CHECK

For the generated summary inspect whether it is genuinely useful.

It should not merely dump:

```text
mission.created
mission.failed
git.commit
...
```

It should organize evidence into useful sections such as:

```text
Major accomplishments
Architecture / engineering
Features implemented
Tests and validation
Deployments
Research / product work
Problems encountered
Resolved issues
Pending work
Evidence / provenance
```

If the current deterministic summary cannot provide this quality yet, do NOT immediately add an LLM.

First improve evidence grouping and deduplication.

An LLM synthesis layer can come after deterministic retrieval is reliable.

